Subject: [PATCH] feat(db): connection management (edit/delete/disconnect),
 stale reconnect, empty states, docs

- Context menu on connection nodes (right-click): Disconnect, Edit, Delete
  - Disconnect clears cached connection and schemas; next expand reconnects
  - Edit opens ConnectionModal pre-filled with existing profile; blank
    password field preserves the existing keychain credential
  - Delete removes profile from connections.json and keychain
- Stale-connection handling: any error during schema/column load drops the
  cached connection and collapses the node so the next expand reconnects
- Empty state: zero-profile panel shows "No connections" + "Add connection"
  button wired to the same modal as the header "+"
- store::delete_password + store::replace_profile_by_id helpers (unit-tested)
- TreeState::clear_connection + TreeState::collapse helpers (unit-tested)
- ConnectionModal extended with edit mode (ConnectionModal::edit)
- README documenting config path, keychain behaviour, actions, and SQL extension

